  "msrv": "rustc 1.95.0 (59807616e 2026-04-14)\nbinary: rustc\ncommit-hash: 59807616e1fa2540724bfbac14d7976d7e4a3860\ncommit-date: 2026-04-14\nhost: x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\nrelease: 1.95.0\nLLVM version: 22.1.2\n",
